00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:11.322
that the corporation
is making, so it

00:04:11.322 --> 00:04:13.050
has to be aligned
with business goals.

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:18.620
Secondly, you want to be able to
justify the return investment.

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:21.579
And last but not
the least is to have

00:04:21.579 --> 00:04:23.250
the right level of visibility.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:29.290
So one question which
commonly comes up

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.970
