00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:35.080
well, I have a slew of APIs.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:37.680
Do I just monetize everything?

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:40.410
Turns out that's not
always a smart choice,

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:43.710
because there are certain
APIs we believe are the right

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:46.830
