monetized, but some aren't.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:49.770
So let's talk about what
are some of the APIs

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:52.850
that shouldn't be monetized.

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:53.350
Right?

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:56.030
So some examples out
here are ticket booking

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:56.910
or store location.

00:04:56.910 --> 00:05:02.240
These are organic core business
APIs which provide value

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:03.630
to your consumers.

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:08.700
However, they provide and
derive indirect value.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.910
So let's say, if you're
Ticketmaster, which also

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.858
happens to be an
Apigee customer,

00:05:12.858 --> 00:05:14.900
they have an application
where you can go and buy

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:17.420
