00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:01.550
So this is what Apigee's API
monetization platform is.

00:08:01.550 --> 00:08:06.190
It's built on the core platform
with monetization capabilities

00:08:06.190 --> 00:08:07.205
integrated into it.

00:08:07.205 --> 00:08:09.080
So let's start from the
very right-hand side.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.580
On the right-hand
side, what you see

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:12.408
are nothing but business assets.

00:08:12.408 --> 00:08:14.950
These are the core enterprise
data assets that we spoke about

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:17.380
in the very, very first slide.

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:21.530
They are exposing modern APIs
