00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:23.670
you may need the
platform to convert them

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:25.480
into modern REST APIs.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:28.230
Once you do that,
API monetization

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:30.180
has two facets to it.

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:33.809
One facet is you as
the API provider.

00:08:33.809 --> 00:08:36.030
So that's one persona
that we tackle.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:38.980
So as an API provider--
in this case, AccuWeather,

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:41.669
they are the provider of APIs--

00:08:41.669 --> 00:08:44.070
you have a set of capabilities
that you need, such

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:47.880
as I need to bundle and create
a package around my APIs.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:51.420
I need to be able to create
rate plans that I can associate

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:53.180
with that offering.

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:54.890
And more importantly,
I want to be

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:57.460
able to do metering, billing.

00:08:57.460 --> 00:09:00.930
All those are capabilities
that an API provider needs.

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:03.210
Now you go to the other
side of the spectrum.

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:05.970
Those APIs are meant
to drive an ecosystem.

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:08.370
They're meant to drive
consumption across partners

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:10.270
and other constituents.

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:12.810
So for the API
consumer, you equally

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:16.980
need the ability for them
to be able to discover APIs,

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:20.520
for them to be able to
subscribe to certain rate plans,

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:21.910
and do things of that nature.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:25.210
So all of that is transacted
through the developer portal.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:27.190
And ultimately,
those APIs that we

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:31.360
spoke about are powering
these connected [INAUDIBLE]

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:34.930
experiences, and the
developer on this side

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:38.640
becomes the key entity
who are the missing

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:44.160
component in ensuring the
success of an API program.

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:47.580
So with Apigee's
API platform, which

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:49.920
is a full-featured,
full lifecycle API

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:52.900
platform with API
